1
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:06,930
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

2
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:06,930
Just like the cruel angel

3
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:14,590
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

4
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:14,590
Young boy, become a legend

5
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:22,410
2D4U PRESENTS:

6
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:25,810
Aoi kaze ga ima

7
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:25,810
Even though the untested breeze...

8
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:29,510
mune no doa o tataitemo

9
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:29,510
...taps at the door to your heart

10
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:36,970
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

11
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:36,970
You just look solely at me and smile

12
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:44,500
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

13
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:44,500
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

14
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:51,400
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

15
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:51,400
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

16
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,750
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

17
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,750
But someday, you are sure to realize...

18
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:58,340
sono senaka ni wa

19
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:58,340
...that upon your back

20
00:00:59,510 --> 00:01:02,960
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

21
00:00:59,510 --> 00:01:02,960
You have the wings with which to fly...

22
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:06,310
no hane ga aru koto

23
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:06,310
...towards the distant future

24
00:01:06,990 --> 00:01:10,690
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

25
00:01:06,990 --> 00:01:10,690
The cruel angel's thesis

26
00:01:10,690 --> 00:01:14,430
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

27
00:01:10,690 --> 00:01:14,430
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

28
00:01:14,430 --> 00:01:18,200
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

29
00:01:14,430 --> 00:01:18,200
With your torrent of ardent pathos

30
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,900
Omoide o uragiru nara

31
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,900
If you are to betray our memories

32
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:25,540
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

33
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:25,540
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

34
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:29,270
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

35
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:29,270
Young boy, become a legend

36
00:01:32,750 --> 00:01:35,140
Apoptosis work for the three Evas
will be performed as scheduled

37
00:01:35,140 --> 00:01:38,140
as soon as the Magi system is reactivated.

38
00:01:38,140 --> 00:01:41,880
Operation confirmed. 450 through 670 omitted.

39
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:43,950
Command has granted approval.

40
00:01:43,950 --> 00:01:45,880
Way to go, Maya. That was fast.

41
00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:48,930
Of course, you're the one who trained me.

42
00:01:48,930 --> 00:01:51,890
Wait a second, A-8 would be faster there.

43
00:01:51,890 --> 00:01:53,480
Let me see that.

44
00:01:53,970 --> 00:01:56,230
Impressive as ever, Ma'am!

45
00:01:56,230 --> 00:01:59,160
How's it going? Are you finished giving
the Magi their check-up?

46
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:03,600
Pretty much. As promised,
we made it in time for today's tests.

47
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:05,040
That's my Ritsuko.

48
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:07,970
Considering it's a tough job with three of them.

49
00:02:07,970 --> 00:02:09,580
That one's cold.

50
00:02:10,310 --> 00:02:12,270
Regular Screening

51
00:02:10,310 --> 00:02:11,650
Under Inspection

52
00:02:11,770 --> 00:02:12,270
Done

53
00:02:12,820 --> 00:02:16,620
All three Magi systems have entered
self-diagnostic mode.

54
00:02:16,620 --> 00:02:19,790
127th routine maintenance, all normal.

55
00:02:19,790 --> 00:02:21,720
Roger. Good work.

56
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:24,500
Everyone, take a break until the tests begin.

57
00:02:31,340 --> 00:02:33,140
Everything checked out.

58
00:02:33,610 --> 00:02:36,100
As usual, Mother's in good shape, but...

59
00:02:36,100 --> 00:02:39,010
Is getting older the only thing I'm going to do?

60
00:02:39,090 --> 00:02:42,010
EPISODE 13
ANGEL INVASION

61
00:02:42,490 --> 00:02:45,780
What? You want me to
take off my clothes again?

62
00:02:45,780 --> 00:02:48,510
The next chamber is an
ultra-clean room environment.

63
00:02:48,510 --> 00:02:51,380
Just taking a shower and changing
your undergarments is insufficient.

64
00:02:51,380 --> 00:02:56,220
Why do I have to go through all this
for a simple autopilot test?

65
00:02:56,220 --> 00:02:58,890
Time isn't just passing us by.

66
00:02:58,890 --> 00:03:01,460
The technology of the Evas
is making progress as well.

67
00:03:01,460 --> 00:03:03,950
We constantly need new data.

68
00:03:07,410 --> 00:03:10,470
All right, here I am, just the way you wanted,

69
00:03:10,470 --> 00:03:13,420
after being run through the wash cycle
seventeen times.

70
00:03:13,420 --> 00:03:16,140
Now, I want all three of you to stay that way

71
00:03:16,140 --> 00:03:18,880
as you walk through the room
and board the entry plug.

72
00:03:18,880 --> 00:03:20,180
What?!

73
00:03:20,180 --> 00:03:22,910
Don't worry. The video monitors
have been shut off.

74
00:03:22,910 --> 00:03:25,020
Your privacy is protected.

75
00:03:25,020 --> 00:03:29,150
That isn't the point! It's an emotional thing!

76
00:03:29,150 --> 00:03:31,760
This test's purpose is to remove the support
of your plug suits

77
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:34,990
and conduct harmonics
directly from your bodies.

78
00:03:34,990 --> 00:03:36,390
Asuka, that's an order.

79
00:03:36,390 --> 00:03:39,710
Oh, fine! Don't you dare peek!

80
00:03:41,450 --> 00:03:44,360
All pilots are ready for entry.

81
00:03:44,980 --> 00:03:46,400
Start the test.

82
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:49,940
Beginning the test. Initiate autopilot recording.

83
00:03:49,940 --> 00:03:51,810
Monitors, nominal.

84
00:03:51,810 --> 00:03:53,830
Inserting simulation plugs.

85
00:03:55,830 --> 00:03:58,380
Connecting simulation bodies to the system.

86
00:03:59,970 --> 00:04:02,940
The simulation plugs are now
under the Magi's control.

87
00:04:03,470 --> 00:04:07,330
Wow, this is going really fast!
Thank goodness for the Magi.

88
00:04:07,330 --> 00:04:10,160
It's hard to believe that the first
experiment took a whole week.

89
00:04:10,160 --> 00:04:12,310
The test is scheduled to end
in approximately three hours.

90
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:15,200
How does it feel?

91
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:16,600
It's a little different.

92
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:19,500
Yes, I think it's different than usual.

93
00:04:19,500 --> 00:04:21,440
The sensations are kind of weird.

94
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:25,040
My right arm is all I can feel clearly.
Everything else is fuzzy.

95
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:27,850
Rei, imagine moving your right hand.

96
00:04:27,850 --> 00:04:28,740
Yes, Ma'am.

97
00:04:35,170 --> 00:04:37,020
Data collection is proceeding smoothly.

98
00:04:37,020 --> 00:04:38,960
There don't seem to be any problems so far.

99
00:04:38,960 --> 00:04:40,130
Return the Magi to their normal state.

100
00:04:41,090 --> 00:04:43,550
RESOLVING

101
00:04:41,090 --> 00:04:43,550
PROCESSING

102
00:04:41,510 --> 00:04:43,250
A dilemma...

103
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:47,570
You can sure see the creator's
personality, can't you?

104
00:04:47,570 --> 00:04:50,970
What are you talking about? You're the one
who created them, right?

105
00:04:50,970 --> 00:04:53,110
You don't know anything, do you?

106
00:04:53,490 --> 00:04:57,940
That's because you don't babble about
yourself like I do, Ritsuko!

107
00:04:57,940 --> 00:05:01,850
That's true. I just brought the system up.

108
00:05:01,850 --> 00:05:04,180
The one who developed the fundamental theory
and the mainframe

109
00:05:03,610 --> 00:05:05,570
SUBMITTED

110
00:05:03,610 --> 00:05:05,570
RESOLVING

111
00:05:03,610 --> 00:05:05,570
PROCESSING

112
00:05:04,180 --> 00:05:05,570
was my mother.

113
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:07,750
You're double-checking this?

114
00:05:07,750 --> 00:05:09,570
Yes, just in case.

115
00:05:08,990 --> 00:05:16,960
SIGMA UNIT D-17
87th PROTEIN WALL

116
00:05:09,570 --> 00:05:12,400
These are the parts that were
brought in three days ago.

117
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:14,560
This is the area that's deteriorating.

118
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:17,240
The 87th protein wall...

119
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:20,370
With magnification, you can see
something that looks like stains.

120
00:05:20,370 --> 00:05:21,500
I wonder what they could be?

121
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:22,900
It's got to be corrosion.

122
00:05:22,900 --> 00:05:25,900
There are slight variations in the
temperature and conduction rates.

123
00:05:25,900 --> 00:05:29,070
Deterioration of sterilized rooms
is happening a lot lately.

124
00:05:29,070 --> 00:05:32,380
The construction schedule was
cut by about sixty days,

125
00:05:32,380 --> 00:05:34,650
so there were probably some air bubbles
mixed in again.

126
00:05:34,650 --> 00:05:37,020
The construction of B Wing is just sloppy.

127
00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:39,820
It was built after the Angels
appeared, after all.

128
00:05:39,820 --> 00:05:43,390
It's not surprising. Everyone's exhausted.

129
00:05:43,390 --> 00:05:45,460
Take care of it by tomorrow.

130
00:05:45,460 --> 00:05:47,130
Otherwise we'll never hear
the end of it from Ikari.

131
00:05:47,130 --> 00:05:47,650
Roger.

132
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:54,270
Another water leak?

133
00:05:54,270 --> 00:05:57,770
No, it's apparently some kind of corrosion
in the protein wall above us.

134
00:05:57,770 --> 00:05:59,170
Wonderful.

135
00:05:59,170 --> 00:06:00,540
Any effect on this test?

136
00:06:00,540 --> 00:06:02,010
No, not at the moment.

137
00:06:02,010 --> 00:06:03,610
Then, let's continue.

138
00:06:03,610 --> 00:06:06,910
We can't abort this test over
minor technical issues.

139
00:06:06,910 --> 00:06:08,750
We'd never hear the end of it
from Commander Ikari.

140
00:06:08,750 --> 00:06:10,980
Roger. Synchronization value is nominal.

141
00:06:10,980 --> 00:06:12,550
No changes to plug signals.

142
00:06:12,550 --> 00:06:15,990
Connecting the simulation plugs to the
Evas via the simulation bodies.

143
00:06:15,990 --> 00:06:17,810
Contact with Eva Unit 00 has been confirmed.

144
00:06:18,570 --> 00:06:21,840
AT Field will be generated at output of 2 yocto.

145
00:06:31,070 --> 00:06:32,340
What's happening?!

146
00:06:32,340 --> 00:06:35,240
We've got a contamination alert
on Floor A in the Sigma unit.

147
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:38,180
The 87th protein wall is corroding
and releasing heat.

148
00:06:38,180 --> 00:06:40,550
Abnormality detected in pipe six as well.

149
00:06:40,550 --> 00:06:43,110
Corrosion area of the protein wall increasing!

150
00:06:43,110 --> 00:06:44,880
At an explosive rate!

151
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:46,320
Abort the experiment.

152
00:06:46,320 --> 00:06:47,880
Initiate emergency shutoff of the sixth pipe.

153
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:49,300
Yes, Ma'am!

154
00:06:48,760 --> 00:06:49,300
CLOSE ALL

155
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,220
EMERGENCY CLOSURE

156
00:06:53,810 --> 00:06:57,330
Numbers 60, 38 and 39 are all closed.

157
00:06:57,330 --> 00:06:59,360
Corrosion has occurred in 6-42.

158
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:02,530
No effect! Corrosion is spreading
along the walls.

159
00:07:02,530 --> 00:07:03,480
Prepare the polysomes.

160
00:07:09,090 --> 00:07:12,760
Set laser power at maximum. Fire upon contact.

161
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:18,080
Corrosion has reached 6-58. It's coming!

162
00:07:30,540 --> 00:07:30,840
Rei!

163
00:07:33,650 --> 00:07:35,970
Rei's simulation body is moving.

164
00:07:35,970 --> 00:07:37,060
Impossible!

165
00:07:45,020 --> 00:07:47,080
The corrosion is spreading further.

166
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:49,230
It's invading the simulation bodies'
suspension system.

167
00:08:03,110 --> 00:08:04,030
How's Rei?!

168
00:08:04,030 --> 00:08:05,650
She's all right.

169
00:08:04,710 --> 00:08:07,100
All plugs emergency eject.

170
00:08:07,100 --> 00:08:07,670
Hurry up with the lasers!

171
00:08:20,130 --> 00:08:21,780
An AT Field?!

172
00:08:21,780 --> 00:08:22,350
It can't be!

173
00:08:29,230 --> 00:08:30,820
What is this?

174
00:08:30,820 --> 00:08:32,620
The pattern analysis is blue.

175
00:08:32,620 --> 00:08:34,110
There's no question. It's an Angel.

176
00:08:37,310 --> 00:08:40,770
An Angel?! You let an Angel get inside?

177
00:08:40,770 --> 00:08:42,330
I'm sorry, Sir.

178
00:08:42,330 --> 00:08:43,870
Save the excuses.

179
00:08:43,870 --> 00:08:45,940
Physically isolate Central Dogma.

180
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:47,670
Quarantine it from Sigma Unit.

181
00:08:47,670 --> 00:08:49,840
Initiating physical isolation of Central Dogma.

182
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:51,700
Quarantining from Sigma Unit.

183
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:52,630
We're abandoning the Box!
All personnel evacuate!

184
00:08:56,430 --> 00:08:57,930
What the hell are you doing? Hurry!

185
00:09:01,830 --> 00:09:04,660
Quarantining Sigma Unit from Floor B.

186
00:09:04,660 --> 00:09:08,210
Closing all partitions. All area
personnel must evacuate.

187
00:09:08,970 --> 00:09:11,980
I know. Please take care of it.

188
00:09:14,010 --> 00:09:15,400
Stop the alarm.

189
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:17,490
Stopping the alarm, Sir.

190
00:09:18,280 --> 00:09:20,840
This is a malfunction, an error
in the alarm system.

191
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:23,210
Report that to both the Japanese
government and the committee.

192
00:09:23,210 --> 00:09:24,410
Yes, Sir!

193
00:09:24,410 --> 00:09:26,140
The contaminated area is descending further.

194
00:09:26,140 --> 00:09:29,100
It's spreading all over Sigma Unit
from the Pribnow Box!

195
00:09:29,860 --> 00:09:31,120
That's a bad area.

196
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:33,380
Yes, it's too close to Adam.

197
00:09:33,730 --> 00:09:36,190
Stop the corrosion within Sigma Unit!

198
00:09:36,190 --> 00:09:39,320
If necessary, sacrifice the Geo-Front.
What's the Evas' status?

199
00:09:39,320 --> 00:09:41,030
Standing by in cage seven.

200
00:09:41,030 --> 00:09:43,230
We can launch them as soon as
the pilots are recovered.

201
00:09:43,230 --> 00:09:46,650
There's no need to wait for the pilots.
Launch them immediately.

202
00:09:47,210 --> 00:09:51,940
Unit 01 has top priority.
Sacrifice the other two if necessary.

203
00:09:51,940 --> 00:09:53,640
Unit 01?

204
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:57,140
But Sir, we can't physically destroy the Angel
without the Evas.

205
00:09:57,140 --> 00:10:01,210
If the Evas are contaminated first,
it'll all be over. Hurry!

206
00:10:01,210 --> 00:10:01,660
Yes, Sir!

207
00:10:04,130 --> 00:10:09,320
All of Central Dogma under Sigma Unit
will be completely closed off in sixty seconds.

208
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:10,960
So that's the Angel.

209
00:10:09,330 --> 00:10:13,100
<i>Thirty seconds until activation
of vacuum pump.</i>

210
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:13,100
Guess I don't have time for work now.

211
00:10:20,950 --> 00:10:23,530
Central Dogma has been completely sealed.

212
00:10:23,530 --> 00:10:26,900
Mega-depth facilities are entirely
occupied by the intruder.

213
00:10:26,900 --> 00:10:29,600
Well now, how will we fight an Angel
without an Eva?

214
00:10:41,770 --> 00:10:44,320
Look, this is the border between
the normal and heavy water.

215
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,720
There's a higher level of oxygen here.

216
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:47,640
Their preference is pretty obvious.

217
00:10:48,710 --> 00:10:53,730
The area where ozone is vented in to maintain
aseptic conditions isn't contaminated.

218
00:10:53,730 --> 00:10:55,930
So does that mean that its weakness is oxygen?

219
00:10:55,930 --> 00:10:56,960
It would seem so.

220
00:11:02,050 --> 00:11:03,540
Injecting ozone.

221
00:11:03,540 --> 00:11:05,360
Concentration is increasing.

222
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,560
It's working, all right.

223
00:11:08,190 --> 00:11:08,980
Will this work?

224
00:11:11,460 --> 00:11:13,990
It appears Zero A and Zero B will recover.

225
00:11:13,990 --> 00:11:16,120
The area around the pipes
has returned to normal.

226
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:18,520
As expected, the central portion
is proving to be tougher.

227
00:11:18,520 --> 00:11:20,280
All right, inject more ozone.

228
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:24,450
This isn't right.

229
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:27,770
What? It's increasing?

230
00:11:27,770 --> 00:11:30,400
Something is wrong. Heat levels are increasing.

231
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:32,800
The contaminated area is spreading again.

232
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:35,310
It's no use! The ozone is no longer
having any effect.

233
00:11:35,310 --> 00:11:37,680
Now it's absorbing the ozone.

234
00:11:37,680 --> 00:11:38,590
Stop the ozone!

235
00:11:40,090 --> 00:11:41,910
Amazing...

236
00:11:41,910 --> 00:11:43,220
It's evolving.

237
00:11:45,180 --> 00:11:46,420
What's wrong?

238
00:11:46,420 --> 00:11:48,350
Something's hacking into the sub-computer.

239
00:11:48,350 --> 00:11:49,820
Intruder unknown.

240
00:11:49,820 --> 00:11:53,360
Not now! Damn it! Dealing with C-mode.

241
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:56,490
Unfreeze the barrier. Open a decoy entry.

242
00:11:56,490 --> 00:11:58,160
Decoy entry has been avoided.

243
00:11:58,160 --> 00:11:59,530
Eighteen seconds to completion of trace.

244
00:11:59,530 --> 00:12:00,780
Deploying barrier.

245
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:02,670
Barrier has been penetrated.

246
00:12:02,670 --> 00:12:04,770
Open another false entry.

247
00:12:04,770 --> 00:12:06,620
No human being could do this.

248
00:12:06,620 --> 00:12:09,370
Trace complete. The hacker is inside this facility!

249
00:12:09,370 --> 00:12:12,370
B Wing basement, in the Pribnow Box!

250
00:12:18,500 --> 00:12:20,550
Optical pattern is changing.

251
00:12:20,550 --> 00:12:22,790
Those glowing lines are electronic circuits.

252
00:12:22,790 --> 00:12:24,660
This is just like a computer.

253
00:12:24,660 --> 00:12:26,240
Opening decoy entry.

254
00:12:26,700 --> 00:12:28,990
Failed. We've been blocked.

255
00:12:28,990 --> 00:12:30,930
Sever the main cable.

256
00:12:30,930 --> 00:12:32,930
Negative, it refuses to accept the command.

257
00:12:32,930 --> 00:12:34,330
Fire the lasers.

258
00:12:34,330 --> 00:12:36,480
It's generating an AT Field. No effect.

259
00:12:36,880 --> 00:12:40,440
It's accessing security's main computer bank.
Cracking the password.

260
00:12:41,090 --> 00:12:43,900
Twelfth digit... sixteenth digit...
D word has been cleared!

261
00:12:44,460 --> 00:12:46,990
It's broken into security's main bank!

262
00:12:47,730 --> 00:12:50,620
It's reading the main bank. We can't stop it.

263
00:12:50,620 --> 00:12:52,580
What is its objective?

264
00:12:52,580 --> 00:12:54,350
Scanning the main bus.

265
00:12:54,350 --> 00:12:56,850
This code is... Oh, no!

266
00:12:56,850 --> 00:12:58,600
It's going to infiltrate the Magi!

267
00:13:03,470 --> 00:13:05,630
Shut down the I/O system.

268
00:13:07,910 --> 00:13:09,400
Count it down!

269
00:13:09,400 --> 00:13:10,640
Three... Two...

270
00:13:10,640 --> 00:13:12,270
One!

271
00:13:14,490 --> 00:13:15,940
We can't cut the power!

272
00:13:16,590 --> 00:13:18,340
The Angel is intruding further.

273
00:13:18,340 --> 00:13:19,860
It's made contact with Melchior.

274
00:13:21,660 --> 00:13:24,270
It's no good! It's going to be taken over!

275
00:13:25,830 --> 00:13:28,360
Melchior has been reprogrammed by the Angel.

276
00:13:29,300 --> 00:13:34,000
Artificial Intelligence Melchior has submitted
an order to independently self-destruct.

277
00:13:30,490 --> 00:13:35,250
SUBMITTED

278
00:13:30,490 --> 00:13:35,250
RESOLVING

279
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:34,000
PROCESSING

280
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:38,880
Rejected. Rejected. Rejected. Rejected.

281
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:35,250
REJECTED

282
00:13:37,140 --> 00:13:41,110
Melchior is now hacking into Balthasar!

283
00:13:42,910 --> 00:13:44,340
Damn it, it's fast!

284
00:13:46,980 --> 00:13:48,640
What computation speed!

285
00:13:56,830 --> 00:13:58,580
Change the logic mode.

286
00:13:58,580 --> 00:14:00,720
Change synchronization code
to every fifteen seconds.

287
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:01,560
Roger!

288
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:09,290
How long will it hold for?

289
00:14:09,290 --> 00:14:12,160
Considering the speed up until now,
maybe two hours.

290
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:14,810
To think that the Magi would turn against us...

291
00:14:22,420 --> 00:14:25,080
We can think of them as micro-machines.

292
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:27,320
Angels the size of microbes.

293
00:14:28,060 --> 00:14:30,310
Those individuals have aggregated together

294
00:14:30,310 --> 00:14:32,420
and have undergone explosive evolution

295
00:14:32,420 --> 00:14:35,720
to achieve intelligence circuits
in this short amount of time.

296
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:37,320
Evolution...

297
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:38,490
Yes.

298
00:14:38,490 --> 00:14:41,360
They're continuously changing themselves,

299
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:44,960
searching for a system that can
cope with any situation.

300
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:49,130
That's truly the system of life itself.

301
00:14:49,130 --> 00:14:51,440
Against an enemy that evolves to
overcome its weaknesses,

302
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:54,610
the only effective countermeasure
is to eliminate the host

303
00:14:54,610 --> 00:14:56,120
and let the parasite die with it.

304
00:14:56,420 --> 00:14:59,040
We have no choice but to
have it die with the Magi.

305
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:01,610
I propose the physical elimination of the Magi.

306
00:15:01,610 --> 00:15:02,710
That's impossible.

307
00:15:02,710 --> 00:15:05,450
Destroying the Magi is tantamount to
destroying headquarters itself.

308
00:15:05,450 --> 00:15:08,450
Then I officially request it on behalf
of the Operations Division.

309
00:15:08,450 --> 00:15:09,890
I refuse.

310
00:15:09,890 --> 00:15:11,990
This is a matter for the Technology Department.

311
00:15:11,990 --> 00:15:13,390
Why are you being so mule-headed?!

312
00:15:15,010 --> 00:15:17,180
This situation is a result of my carelessness.

313
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:21,000
You've always been like this.

314
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:23,200
You always take the responsibility
on your own shoulders

315
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:25,120
and won't depend on others.

316
00:15:27,850 --> 00:15:31,610
If the Angel keeps evolving, we have a chance.

317
00:15:31,610 --> 00:15:33,310
Expedite its evolution?

318
00:15:33,310 --> 00:15:34,480
Yes.

319
00:15:34,480 --> 00:15:38,180
The end of evolution is self-destruction.
Death itself.

320
00:15:38,180 --> 00:15:42,170
Thus, we just need to accelerate its evolution.

321
00:15:42,500 --> 00:15:45,420
If the Angel considers it the only
practical means of survival,

322
00:15:45,420 --> 00:15:48,030
it may choose to co-exist with the Magi system.

323
00:15:48,030 --> 00:15:50,210
But how?

324
00:15:50,640 --> 00:15:53,060
If the target is a computer itself,

325
00:15:53,060 --> 00:15:56,270
we can counter-hack it by
connecting Casper to the Angel

326
00:15:56,270 --> 00:16:00,440
and uploading a self-destruct
acceleration program, but...

327
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:04,740
At the same time, we'll be turning off
the barrier to the Angel.

328
00:16:04,740 --> 00:16:08,950
So it would be a battle of speed
between Casper and the Angel.

329
00:16:08,950 --> 00:16:09,650
Yes.

330
00:16:09,650 --> 00:16:12,520
That program had better make it on time.

331
00:16:12,520 --> 00:16:15,110
If Casper is contaminated as well, it'll all be over.

332
00:16:17,870 --> 00:16:19,760
I'll keep my promise.

333
00:16:19,760 --> 00:16:22,930
Alert R issued! Alert R issued!

334
00:16:22,930 --> 00:16:26,730
An emergency has occurred
in Nerv Headquarters.

335
00:16:26,730 --> 00:16:30,080
All D-class personnel must evacuate.

336
00:16:39,690 --> 00:16:42,520
What is all this?

337
00:16:49,630 --> 00:16:51,190
Scribbles left by the developer.

338
00:16:51,190 --> 00:16:55,630
Amazing! These are back doors!
Magi's back doors!

339
00:16:55,630 --> 00:16:58,610
So it's a veritable encyclopedia
of all the tricks up the Magi's sleeve.

340
00:16:59,180 --> 00:17:01,100
Is it okay to see these?

341
00:17:01,100 --> 00:17:04,590
What a surprise! This is INT-C!

342
00:17:05,750 --> 00:17:09,390
With these we can program much faster
than we thought, right, Ma'am?

343
00:17:11,300 --> 00:17:15,970
IKARI, YOU JERK!

344
00:17:12,090 --> 00:17:15,470
Thank you, Mother.
We can make it for sure now.

345
00:17:26,940 --> 00:17:28,650
Give me the wrench.

346
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:33,930
Doesn't this remind you of our college days?

347
00:17:33,930 --> 00:17:35,850
Board number twenty-five.

348
00:17:40,820 --> 00:17:44,150
Hey, tell me a little about the Magi.

349
00:17:44,860 --> 00:17:46,940
It's a long story.

350
00:17:46,940 --> 00:17:49,420
And not a very interesting one, at that.

351
00:17:50,230 --> 00:17:52,850
Do you know about personality transplant OS?

352
00:17:52,850 --> 00:17:56,250
Yes, it's a system that implants
an individual's personality

353
00:17:56,250 --> 00:17:59,890
into a seventh generation organic computer
so it can think.

354
00:17:59,890 --> 00:18:03,130
It's the same technology used
for operating the Evas, right?

355
00:18:03,130 --> 00:18:05,560
I've heard Magi was the first of them.

356
00:18:06,840 --> 00:18:11,020
My mother developed the technology.

357
00:18:12,050 --> 00:18:15,270
So, it was her personality that was implanted?

358
00:18:15,270 --> 00:18:16,860
Right.

359
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:30,570
In a very real sense, this is my mother's brain.

360
00:18:31,570 --> 00:18:34,160
Is that why you wanted to protect the Magi?

361
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:38,550
I don't think so. I didn't really
like my mother that much.

362
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:41,470
This was a decision as a scientist.

363
00:18:42,050 --> 00:18:43,800
There it is!

364
00:18:43,800 --> 00:18:45,470
Balthasar has been taken over!

365
00:18:46,280 --> 00:18:49,870
Independent self-destruct has been approved
by the artificial intelligence.

366
00:18:49,870 --> 00:18:51,260
Has it begun?!

367
00:18:50,220 --> 00:18:55,180
Self-destruct device will be triggered 02 seconds
after the consent of all three members.

368
00:18:55,180 --> 00:19:03,490
Self-destruct will encompass geoid depth
- 280, -140 and Floor Zero.

369
00:19:03,490 --> 00:19:07,020
Special Command 582 requires the consent

370
00:19:06,640 --> 00:19:09,190
Balthasar is now invading Casper!

371
00:19:07,020 --> 00:19:10,160
of two computers to cancel the action.

372
00:19:09,190 --> 00:19:10,160
We're losing ground!

373
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:11,750
What speed!

374
00:19:15,410 --> 00:19:18,400
Twenty seconds to self-destruct.

375
00:19:18,400 --> 00:19:19,370
Not good!

376
00:19:19,370 --> 00:19:21,870
Casper will be taken over in eighteen seconds!

377
00:19:21,870 --> 00:19:25,280
Fifteen seconds to self-destruct.

378
00:19:25,280 --> 00:19:26,580
Ritsuko, hurry!

379
00:19:26,580 --> 00:19:29,450
No problem. I've got almost
one whole second to spare.

380
00:19:26,580 --> 00:19:29,450
Ten seconds to self-destruct.

381
00:19:29,450 --> 00:19:30,820
Only one?!

382
00:19:29,530 --> 00:19:30,820
9...

383
00:19:30,820 --> 00:19:32,880
At least it's not a zero or a minus.

384
00:19:30,820 --> 00:19:31,720
8...

385
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:32,880
7...

386
00:19:32,880 --> 00:19:34,050
6...

387
00:19:33,100 --> 00:19:34,050
Maya!

388
00:19:34,050 --> 00:19:35,270
We're set!

389
00:19:34,050 --> 00:19:35,270
5...

390
00:19:35,270 --> 00:19:35,980
4...

391
00:19:35,980 --> 00:19:37,190
3...

392
00:19:37,190 --> 00:19:38,260
2...

393
00:19:37,190 --> 00:19:38,260
Hit it!

394
00:19:38,260 --> 00:19:39,420
1...

395
00:19:39,420 --> 00:19:40,700
Zero.

396
00:19:52,250 --> 00:19:56,040
Independent self-destruct has been canceled
by the artificial intelligence.

397
00:19:56,040 --> 00:19:57,370
All right!

398
00:19:57,370 --> 00:20:01,450
Furthermore, Special Command 582
has also been canceled.

399
00:20:01,450 --> 00:20:04,230
Magi system returning to normal mode.

400
00:20:14,810 --> 00:20:18,230
Alert R canceled. Alert R canceled.

401
00:20:18,230 --> 00:20:22,650
All hands return to first stage alert.

402
00:20:20,580 --> 00:20:22,650
What the heck's going on?

403
00:20:24,750 --> 00:20:29,050
Jeez, I can't go anywhere naked!

404
00:20:29,050 --> 00:20:32,060
Somebody hurry up and help me!

405
00:20:33,860 --> 00:20:38,540
Sigma Unit released. T minus zero three
to Magi system reactivation.

406
00:20:40,970 --> 00:20:44,560
Maybe I'm getting old. Staying up for
these all-nighters is rough.

407
00:20:44,560 --> 00:20:47,420
You kept your promise again.

408
00:20:47,420 --> 00:20:49,030
Good job.

409
00:20:49,030 --> 00:20:50,610
Thank you.

410
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:58,770
This is the first time I've ever really
appreciated your coffee.

411
00:21:00,320 --> 00:21:03,140
The night before she died,
my mother told me

412
00:21:03,140 --> 00:21:05,490
that the Magi are three aspects of herself.

413
00:21:06,220 --> 00:21:08,310
Herself as a scientist.

414
00:21:08,310 --> 00:21:09,880
Herself as a mother.

415
00:21:09,880 --> 00:21:11,650
Herself as a woman.

416
00:21:11,650 --> 00:21:15,250
The Magi is those three aspects
struggling for dominance.

417
00:21:15,250 --> 00:21:18,100
She intentionally left in the dilemmas
of human experience.

418
00:21:18,470 --> 00:21:21,510
Actually, each of the three programs
are slightly different.

419
00:21:23,040 --> 00:21:25,600
I don't think I'll ever be a mother,

420
00:21:25,600 --> 00:21:28,170
so I don't understand her as a mother.

421
00:21:28,170 --> 00:21:31,480
But I respected her as a scientist.

422
00:21:31,980 --> 00:21:35,320
However, as a woman, I even hated her.

423
00:21:37,090 --> 00:21:39,180
You're rather talkative today.

424
00:21:39,180 --> 00:21:40,230
It's been known to happen.

425
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:50,370
Casper contains the pattern of her as a woman.

426
00:21:50,840 --> 00:21:55,040
She stayed a woman to the last.
How totally like my mother.

427
00:21:55,750 --> 00:22:00,710
TO BE CONTINUED

428
00:23:06,070 --> 00:23:06,980
PREVIEW

429
00:23:07,070 --> 00:23:11,530
Nerv, and the secret organization Seele that is
behind the Human Instrumentality Project.

430
00:23:11,600 --> 00:23:15,200
Are Commander Ikari's actions solely to realize
what is contained in the Dead Sea Scrolls?

431
00:23:15,270 --> 00:23:17,790
Next episode: "Seele, Throne of Souls"

432
00:23:17,790 --> 00:23:20,500
And there'll be more fan service next time too!

433
00:23:18,700 --> 00:23:21,080
SEELE, THRONE OF SOULS
